== Notes ==

* Due to Convergence Orbs having a rather long cooldown between spawns, Tauron Strikes are '''less useful and effective''' in missions that are either quick or have optional enemy kills, such as [[Capture]] and [[Sabotage]]. Conversely, longer missions or those with a large amount of enemy spawns allows Tauron Strikes to be used properly and frequently.
* Tauron Strikes appear to completely ignore [[Damage Attenuation]], making them able to swiftly defeat bosses/special enemies who have their healthbars displayed in the top-center of the HUD, regardless of [[The Steel Path|Steel Path]] being enabled. Multi-healthbar enemies who have brief invulnerability throughout their fights (after emptying one of their healthbars) require multiple Tenno to use their Tauron Strikes in a sequence that matches the enemy's vulnerability periods. 

